Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interdimensional travel is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just nice to be\Nback in our home world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd all burn out without a break\Nfrom work every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But time off's in short supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the fresh air while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never really noticed till\Nnow, but she's really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look ahead when you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:03:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, may I ask where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki! Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Yuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he went out with the\Ncommander for some time off earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did? Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari took them to the Yamagata Passage\Nwhile she was out on her regular patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
