Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.14,0:03:39.19,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\blur6\fnSigvarRandom\pos(1736.98,342.34)}{\an8\c&HE2E5E2&}Memorial Monument
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.19,0:03:39.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\blur6\fnSigvarRandom\an8\c&HE2E5E2&\pos(1738.13,303.69)}Mato Mishap
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.19,0:03:39.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\blur6\fnSigvarRandom\pos(1739.5,344.11)}{\an8\c&HE2E5E2&}Memorial Monument
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.23,0:03:39.27,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=25}{\fs40\blur6\fnSigvarRandom\an8\c&HE2E5E2&\pos(1740.66,305.57)}Mato Mishap
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.23,0:03:39.27,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=23}{\fs40\blur6\fnSigvarRandom\pos(1742.03,345.99)}{\an8\c&HE2E5E2&}Memorial Monument
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them was especially powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember it as though it were yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had a single horn that stuck\Nout from the top of its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I called it the Unihorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the Shuki that crossed\Nover that day were wiped
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out by the demon defense\Nforce who arrived to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.57,0:04:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after looking through the records,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I discovered the Unihorn managed to\Nescape back through the gateway into Mato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then the Unihorn is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a score to settle\Nwith that damn Shuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I will destroy that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.85,0:04:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want you to be prepared\Nfor when that day comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I brought\Nyou here to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will avenge everyone who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to go back to Mato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Miss Kyouka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we take a break first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a little research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cafe is famous for its parfaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mato is far more important. Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:04:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but make it short.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more assertive than\NI thought you would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you enjoy sweet treats\Nlike everyone else, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just more concerned about\Nmotto than I am about desserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost my big sister in a motto mishap a\Nwhile ago, so it's important to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll miss your chance at vengeance\Nif you run yourself ragged first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd burn out without a break from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Persuasion is another forte of yours,\NI see. Very nice. Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how good this parfait really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just caught up in my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing a smile on Kyoka's\Nface for the first
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time actually brought back\Nmemories of my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took your suggestion from yesterday\Nand added a little bit of Yuzu citrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a smart little cookie,\NI give it a million thumbs up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up all of your hard work, okay, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys are defined by their\Nskills in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, um, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The parfaits here really\Nare as good as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A conch shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency call from Mato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single blow of the shell\Nmeans it's not life-threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something serious is\Nhappening nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want that here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wiped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it back home in no time flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start by helping me take these off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, is this my reward from your ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what the hell else\Ncould it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up. Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, we're deep in fetish territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I'm wishing for\Nthis kind of stuff subconsciously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exactly what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a discovery made\Nduring today's patrols.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crater-like formation appeared\Nabout 21 kilometers to the south,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with a large number of Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are all of those red dots\Nsupposed to be Shuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crater, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not making any moves\Nto leave that area either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a nest of some kind, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies for ruining your day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This problem needs our attention
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a huge undertaking\Nfor the seventh squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's smash them all like bugs
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's fired up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll ride in three vehicles
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I count as the third vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going on ahead. Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:08:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be horrific if\Nany people got stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's clear them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take the seventh squad's perfect\Nteamwork to eliminate all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they merge, it'll be easier\Nthan taking them down one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll crush the big one and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shuki are tough bastards, but\Ntheir fighting style is simplistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our strategy is flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they've reshaped, we will\Ndestroy them once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be ready to jump into battle at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's Kyouka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One horn on top of its head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to join the party. It talks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's not a very nice thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.41,0:10:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I have more than a sharp tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that felt good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, aren't we a tough one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.79,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That unicorn will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, it sounds like they have\Na cute little nickname for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him, the bastard who\Ndestroyed Kyoka's hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You! On the Shuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say I'm the\NDemon Defense Force's archenemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amato Peach?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you seen\Nmy little brother anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, seeing as he's\Nincredibly handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little brother? There\Nare more of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little brother was\Nobsessed with me when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were younger always\Nfollowing me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Annoying, but adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In spite of that, the instant he got\Nolder, he turned into such a rabble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those were the fun days, because\NI got to knock some manners into him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a Shuuki? Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.55,0:12:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that matters right now is that this\None's clearly different from the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little brother's name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about my brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't get to wrap me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be their supreme commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything\Nabout Mato, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a world filled with curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a nice shuki of your\Nown, but it's time to say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't Akura. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run away from me! Miss Kyouka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do exactly what you did\Nto all those fleeing villagers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tear you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari and Shushu, safety is priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna pull back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let my rage take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it almost cost me my squadmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, their wounds\Nare relatively minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be fully recovered by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the kind of filthy rewards\Nthat come out of your subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The demands of my inner psyche\Nare starting to terrify me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.33,0:14:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In regards to that last battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of questions and\Ncomments to go over with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have something I want\Nto report to you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But does it have to be\Nwhile we're like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this reward of yours isn't\Ngoing to end anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry that\Nthe Unihorn got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu's and Himari's\Nlives were more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate all that you did out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you have an interesting\Nway of showing it. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is something that you\Nsubconsciously asked for, you perverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the Unihorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That humanoid riding on top of it\Nmust be some species of Shuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.19,0:15:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy to think that a\NShuki could speak our language.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This news is going to\Nshock the entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, speaking of that new species,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember when I told you\Nabout my missing big sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that thing kind of resembled her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it might\Nbe your sister? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a feeling I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:16:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But also, it had a strange\Nreaction when it saw my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it did say something about\Nsearching for a little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm betting that just triggered\Nmemories of your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it told us that its brother is\Nsupposedly the most handsome man ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't describe me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a ridiculous thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, no ordinary human\Ncould ever be that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition, nobody's ever heard of\Na human becoming a Shuuki before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're most certainly bound\Nto cross paths again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we won't stop looking\Nuntil we find them. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird how happy you seem\Nabout getting stepped on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the view is nice from down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyoka seemed convinced that\Nit was a humanoid species of Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it really was my sister, why would\Nshe be attacking the demon defense forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How has she stayed alive all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is she working\Nwith that horn monstrosity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we see them again, what should I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Mr. Yuuki! Mr. Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the pot is boiling over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I was spacing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kneel down here, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as your senpai Nei needs to take\Ncare of some serious business!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expose this to danger,\Nand you must be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Senpai, punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a big day out there fighting those\Ntough enemies to save Shushu from danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tired and your body\Nand brain need a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the best cook, but\NI can make simple meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to handle dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of being a good senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve such an amazing senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I would however take your help\Nplating the food, would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can figure out whether she's my\Nsister or not the next time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I gotta focus on work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crawling back here with injuries, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought you were\Nabove such disgraces, Alba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got taken by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Coco.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.73,0:18:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Yuuki, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know why\Nhe looked like a Shuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An experiment by the demon defense force?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the ability of that woman riding him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did they start letting\Nguys in their organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was a nice reunion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:18:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, the Unicorn was\Ncrazy powerful. If we
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight again you're already back in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, tip-top shape, and thank you\Nfor saving me when I was in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't I let you return the\Nfavor with a nice little back scrub?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, enough with the jokes already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to turn around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm completely naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just quiet down and\Nlet me wash your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, big guy, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she actually naked back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't risk turning\Naround if that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu's pulling this\Nlittle prank because she
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thinks I'm not the type of\Nguy who would turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe that's just what\Nshe wants me to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear that most people are\Nprone to playing it safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so confidently turning around and saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you had a swimsuit\Non, now get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be the smart move in\Norder to teach her a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't bored yesterday, Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warm the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Away from me, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki just saw me naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now my heart's racing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're ready to find me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.63,0:20:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put up a sign that said Bath Occupied!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you should have\Nmade it more clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that it was a guy in the\Nbath, you perverted asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never a dull moment\Nwith the seventh squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruder alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're members of the sixth squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.81,0:21:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the commander, Miss Tenka Izumo.
Dialogue: 11,0:21:10.86,0:21:12.86,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.8\fs200\c&HF4844A&\pos(635.36,977.26)}IZUMO TENKA
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.86,0:21:12.86,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.8\fs200\c&H400F08&\pos(625.36,979.26)}IZUMO TENKA
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.59,0:21:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm her second-in-command, Yachiho Azuma.
Dialogue: 11,0:21:17.61,0:21:19.58,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.8\fs200\c&HE65691&\pos(388.21,933.03)}AZUMA YACHIHO
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.61,0:21:19.58,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.8\fs200\c&H400F08&\pos(399.33,934.26)}AZUMA YACHIHO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Azuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the slave I've\Nheard so much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, go fetch Kyo for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you mean Miss Kyouka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.61,0:21:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take my power\Nto the power of my body.
