Dialogue: 11,0:23:12.75,0:23:17.26,Signs - Style 1,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.8\fs250\c&H000000&\pos(604.66,645.61)}PROMISE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.81,0:23:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today we're going to talk about my Peach\Nability called Share Defined Promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.09,0:23:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Known as Clairvoyance, this\Nallows me to see places far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.53,0:23:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which I used to find\NShuki and Mato victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can also share the POV of a\Nperson who's touched me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's valued by scouting teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.15,0:23:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some places I can't see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.71,0:23:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like inside caves, and it's\Npretty useless in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.33,0:23:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I believe that I have my own\Nrole to play and always give my best.
